# Interview Questions

### 1. What is DevOps?

DevOps is a culture and set of practices that improves collaboration between Development and 
Operations teams by automating software delivery and deployment.

---

### 2. Why DevOps?

- Faster releases
- Better collaboration
- Reduced errors
- Continuous feedback
- Improved software quality

